\viewkind4\uc1\pard\tx3780\tx3960\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Jesus, we on the word depend
\par Spoken by Thee while present here :
\par The Father in My name shall send 
\par The Holy Ghost, the Comforter.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. That promise made to Adam's race,
\par Now, Lord, in us, even us, fufil;
\par And give the Spirit of Thy grace,
\par To teach us all Thy perfect will.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. That heavenly Teacher of mankind,
\par That Guide infallible impart,
\par To bring Thy sayings to our mind,
\par And write them on our faithful heart.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. He only can the words apply 
\par Through which we endless life possess ;
\par And deal to each his legacy,
\par His Lord's unutterable peace.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. That peace of God, that peace of Thine,
\par O might He now to us bring in,
\par And fill our souls with power divine,
\par And make an end of fear and sin.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. The length and breadth of love reveal,
\par The height and depth of Deity;
\par And all the sons of glory seal,
\par And change, and make us all like Thee;
\par                                               Amen.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

